<title>NETHERLANDS: ECONOSTO 1996 NET PROFIT SHARPLY UP.</title>
<headline>ECONOSTO 1996 NET PROFIT SHARPLY UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.08 vs   1.42</p>
<p>    Net profit			    13.6  vs   8.1</p>
<p>    Turnover			     510    vs 371</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    24.8  vs  14.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Technical wholesaler Koninklijke Econosto NV</p>
<p>previously said it expected a 1996 full-year net profit of about</p>
<p>13 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.00 vs   0.80</p>
<p>NOTE - The 1996 dividend can be taken up in cash or as an</p>
<p>optional payment in new Econosto shares. Details of the optional</p>
<p>stock dividend will be published on May 6.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
